      "side": 1,
      "message": "If you make the decisions about skipping to account the change only based on swap_info_struct, I would suggest to have only one vendor hook:\n```\ntrace_android_vh_account_nr_swap_pages(struct swap_info_struct *si, unsigned int nr_entries, bool *skip);\n```\n\nThen `trace_android_vh_add_nr_swap_pages(si, nr_entries, \u0026skip)` becomes `trace_android_vh_account_nr_swap_pages(si, nr_entries, \u0026skip)`, `trace_android_vh_dec_nr_swap_pages(si, \u0026skip)` becomes `trace_android_vh_account_nr_swap_pages(si, -1, \u0026skip)`, `trace_android_vh_enable_swap_info(p, true, \u0026skip)` becomes  `trace_android_vh_account_nr_swap_pages(p, p-\u003epages, \u0026skip)`, `trace_android_vh_enable_swap_info(p, false, \u0026skip)` becomes `trace_android_vh_account_nr_swap_pages(p, -p-\u003epages, \u0026skip)`.",
